      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's hear the final words of the season.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Утро пришло.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Morning has come.' The illusion is finally broken.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Теперь все ясно.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Now everything is clear.' The reality is obvious now.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Но уже поздно.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'But it is already late.' Time has passed while we slept.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Время ушло.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Time has gone.' We can never get it back.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Это наша общая ошибка.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is our common mistake.' We have to accept the blame.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Может быть, стоило проснуться?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Maybe we should have woken up?' A regretful thought.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Проснуться раньше?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Woken up sooner?' It would have saved a lot of pain.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Я не знаю ответ.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I don't know the answer.' There are no easy answers.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Никто не знает.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Nobody knows.' We all struggle with the same things.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Жизнь продолжается.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Life goes on.' We have to keep moving despite everything.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Нужно идти.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Need to go.' It is time to face the future.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Идти только вперед.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Go only forward.' The only direction left. Now let's hear the whole thing once more.",
      "gap": 0.9
